  <scopecontent id="dac4a2b50c14d2e96eea40732dc210b1">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>Photographs of the interior and exterior of Philipsburg Manor, Van Cortlandt Manor, the Old Dutch Church, and Sunnyside. There are also photographs of art, books, and furniture from the Rockefeller Memorial Room. Many of these pieces are now at Kykuit.</p>  </scopecontent>
